WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,900
Tip, the room you are currently upgrading is an unbound room.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:10,220
Please consider carefully

3
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:13,540
The data is exactly the same as my door

4
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:16,340
But there’s no such weird introduction.

5
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,040
It seems that only as a homeowner

6
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,040
