14
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,160
I have hope to survive

15
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,460
Classmate Chen An

16
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,670
I have already traded the gift pack to you

17
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:46,190
I won't bother you

18
00:00:46,190 --> 00:00:48,590
I didn’t expect Zhao Jiahao to be a lone wolf

19
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:51,490
He was actually able to grab gift bags from so many people.
